Real Steel is a 2011 American science fiction sports film starring Hugh Jackman.

12
01:03:30,000 --> 01:03:36,000
Produced and directed by Shawn Levy, the film is based on the short story "Steel", written by Richard Matheson, which was originally
published in the May 1956 edition of The Magazine of Fantasy & Science Fiction, and later adapted into a 1963 Twilight Zone episode.

13
01:08:47,500 --> 01:08:53,500
The story features a down-on-his-luck former boxer (Jackman), whose sport is now played by robots, as he
and his son (Dakota Goyo) find an abandoned robot and train it to be a promising fighter.

14
01:14:05,000 --> 01:14:11,000
Evangeline Lilly,  Anthony Mackie, and Kevin Durand star in supporting roles.

15
01:19:22,500 --> 01:19:28,500
The film was in development for several years before
production began on June 24, 2010.

16
